From: Tetris port maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] pmdomain: mediatek: isolate MT6878 modem sequencing

Source: Nothing OS 4.1 device modules
ee2be53cb75670b548948636a0db1d1ff112bf12, mtk-scpsys-mt6878.c
and scpsys_md_power_on/off in mtk-scpsys.c.

Use a separate controller compatible with two access-controller phandles
(IFR, NEMICFG), leaving the existing display controller unchanged. Register
only a fully protected, isolated, powered-off modem; reject inherited ON or
mixed acknowledgements without touching hardware. Do not operate reset_b,
PWR_ON_2ND, SRAM or the generic isolation/clock-disable bits. Any transition
failure latches its first error until reboot, without speculative rollback.

No DT nodes or consumers are enabled. Modem reset, EMI ownership and firmware
handoff remain separate prerequisites; this provider does not start firmware.

